# Two Innkeeper's Talents at level 2 each give "Permanents you control with counters on them have ward {1}": Bot1's
# Ornithopter, with counters from both Talents' level-1 triggers, has two instances of ward {1}, and each triggers on its
# own (CR 113.2c, 702.21a). Turn 2, Bot2's Lightning Bolt at it puts two ward triggers on the stack; Bot2 pays the first {1}
# with its Mox Ruby, can't pay the second, and the Bolt is countered - with one ward, paying once would have let it
# resolve.

